sequenceDiagram
      actor Clinician
      participant OpenMRS
      participant AF_OMRS as Atomfeed (OpenMRS DB)
      participant PACSInteg as PACS Integration
      participant DCM4CHEE as DCM4CHEE (DICOM)
      participant Device as Radiology Device
      actor RadTech as Radiology Tech

      Clinician->>OpenMRS: Create radiology order
      OpenMRS->>AF_OMRS: Publish radiology order event

      PACSInteg->>AF_OMRS: Poll events
      AF_OMRS-->>PACSInteg: Radiology order
      PACSInteg->>DCM4CHEE: Create Modality Worklist entry (HL7 MWL)

      RadTech->>Device: Select patient from worklist
      Device->>DCM4CHEE: C-FIND worklist query
      DCM4CHEE-->>Device: Patient/procedure info
      RadTech->>Device: Perform scan
      Device->>DCM4CHEE: C-STORE DICOM image (:11112)

      Clinician->>OpenMRS: View radiology result
      OpenMRS-->>Clinician: Redirect to PACS viewer (:8055)
      DCM4CHEE-->>Clinician: DICOM image viewer